WEBVTT

00:00:13.490 --> 00:00:15.280
Wow!

00:00:16.370 --> 00:00:17.950
The ocean looks so pretty!

00:00:17.950 --> 00:00:21.700
Lord Dizelmine! I want to go too!

00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:25.620
I wish I could take you there too, Yuriyuri.

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:26.960
Really?

00:00:28.210 --> 00:00:29.420
Then let's go today!

00:00:29.420 --> 00:00:33.090
I can't. Today, I have an important meeting to attend.

00:00:33.090 --> 00:00:35.300
We'll go for a visit some other day.

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:39.350
Huh? That's no fun. Boo!

00:00:40.760 --> 00:00:46.400
You might get sick again if you overexert yourself.

00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:48.770
{You should be taking a break after our long journey.}You should take this time to rest.

00:00:49.820 --> 00:00:50.770
Okay?

00:00:50.770 --> 00:00:52.440
Okay!

00:00:57.530 --> 00:01:00.030
I realize this is part of your duties,

00:01:00.030 --> 00:01:01.790
but I still must applaud you.

00:01:01.790 --> 00:01:04.200
She's our trump card.

00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:07.540
Assign more chaperons to her so that she doesn't go off on her own.

00:01:07.540 --> 00:01:08.960
I will pass on your instructions.

00:01:09.750 --> 00:01:10.960
I'm counting on ya.

